1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Are you looking down at your phone right now?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Tilt your head just 15 degrees and your neck holds 12kg.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:16,100
At 60 degrees it hits 27kg - like a child on your neck!

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:22,700
Reset your posture - back and head flat against a wall.

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:27,300
Do chin-tucks every day to straighten your neck.

